@flexiarg self-heal/a-different-seat-reviews
@title A Different Seat Reviews The Repair
@keywords independent review, author not reviewer, authority, trust manifest
@audience the War Machine and agents repairing it
@tone design
@style pattern
@status draft 2026-10-28 (claude-11, from ~/notes/repair-patterns/witnesses-machine-repairs-2026-10-28.md K7 and witnesses-intake-and-extension-2026-10-28.md K6)
@role review
@guard needs: the diff, the red-before record, the path witness, and a seat that did not author the repair.
@effect a review receipt from another seat records the diff read, whether the tests pin what the repair claims, and what was re-executed; authorization, review and evaluation are separate receipts.
@predicts reviews find defects in a share of repairs (the record has reviews that changed the repair); a repair the reviewer refuses does not proceed to disposition.
@references [coordination/bind-promotion-to-post-repair-replay apparatus/one-authority-per-question self-heal/retire-by-appending-to-the-ledger]
! conclusion: The repair is judged by a seat that did not write it, on the diff and on whether its tests pin the claim, and that judgment is its own receipt.

  + context: A repair has a path witness and is about to be activated or disposed.

  + IF:
    Disposition of the injury will rest on this repair.

  + HOWEVER:
    The author's log already says green, and a second run of the same tests buys no judgment. Merging and reviewing in one act loses which was which.

  + THEN:
    Another seat reads the diff, judges test adequacy (would these tests catch the likely bug?), re-executes selectively, and records a review receipt separate from the authorization and from the evaluation. Evidence may overrule the review brief; that is recorded too.

  + BECAUSE:
    The disposition step trusts this receipt; if the author wrote it, nothing independent stands behind the retirement.

  + evidence:
    - machine K7.1, review-notes-claude-11.md:3-12: "Verdict: genuine-repair-qualified ... I reran the namespace at 9b1cbba12". Worked.
    - machine K7.2, t3-retirement/genuine-repair/trusted-manifest.edn:1: separate `:authorization`, `:review`, `:evaluation` receipts. Worked.
    - machine K7.3-K7.5, futon2 694cde52b, 2993fc0f1/e189b0c33, fcb0110c7/10f88008e: merge and independent review recorded as distinct commits.
    - intake K6.3, TN-apm-principle-scoring-ledger.md:519-534: "useful precisely because it argued against what the reviewer had asked for."
    - intake K6.7, T-meta-self-heal-dedicated-transaction.md:114-119: the architectural diagnosis came from reviewing all five patches together.
